    <http://ld.company.org/prod-vocab/>, 
    <http://ld.company.org/.well-known/void#>,
    <http://ld.company.org/.well-known/examples#>,
    <http://ld.company.org/.well-known/shapes#>,
    <https://text2sparql.aksw.org/2025/corporate/queries/> .